  {
   "id": 639478,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Although the scientific method is used by most of the sciences, it can also be applied to everyday situations. A situation is given below. Using the scientific method try to arrange the given steps in the correct order. \nSituation:\n<ol>\n  <li>If the car doesn’t start the problem might be in the battery.</li>\n  <li>Car doesn’t start.</li>\n  <li>After changing the battery. Car starts working.</li>\n  <li>The car should start after charging the battery or changing the battery.</li>\n  <li>The car doesn’t start because the battery is dead.</li>\n  <li>The car doesn’t start even after charging the battery, the battery must have stopped working.</li>\n</ol>\n",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1245462,
     "content_html": "1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6"
    },
    {
